<title>USA: TABLE-Dynex Capital sells $100 mln notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Dynex Capital sells $100 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from</p>
<p>Dynex Capital Inc was priced Monday, according to lead manager</p>
<p>PaineWebber Inc.</p>
<p>Dynex Capital Inc is a REIT which originates mortgage</p>
<p>loans secured by mult-family and commercial real estate</p>
<p>properties and makes loans secured by manufactured homes.</p>
<p>BORROWER DYNEX CAPITAL INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.875 PCT  MATURITY 7/15/2002</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.90   FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA2   YIELD 7.899 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-PLUS   SPREAD +175 BPS   MAKE-WHOLE CALL AT +25</p>
<p>						  BASIS POINTS OVER THE</p>
<p>						    U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
